# Styling (INCENTRAL-WEBSITE)

Project root: `/Users/vanshikasanan/Personal Projects/incentral/INCENTRAL-WEBSITE`

## Hard rule — no new CSS files

- **Do not create** any new `.css` file anywhere under this project (including `src/styles/`, `src/components/`, `src/app/`, `public/`, etc.).
- **Do not add** new `@import` lines in `globals.css` for separate stylesheets.
- **Do not copy** v375 reference CSS into new files in this repo — port visuals with **Tailwind utilities** and **shadcn/ui** in `.tsx` instead.

## Allowed

- **Edit only** the existing `src/app/globals.css` when unavoidable (`@import "tailwindcss"`, `@theme`, minimal `@layer base/components` tokens). Prefer Tailwind in components first.
- **Legacy:** Existing files under `src/styles/v375/` and their current `globals.css` imports may remain until migrated away; then **delete** those files and remove imports — do not replace them with new CSS files.

## Implementation

- Use **Tailwind** + **`cn()`** + **shadcn/ui** for all new UI, fixes, and migrations.
- **Product copy/config:** `src/config/plan-pdp/` and related config — not inline in components.
- Plan accents: `planAccentTokens` / inline `style` when utilities cannot express per-card colors.
